  "title": "Elon Musk's Attack on Ambani and Starlink Launch Delay",
  "summary": "Elon Musk accused Indian billionaire Mukesh Ambani of seeking to protect his monopoly and urge him to allow Starlink competition in India. The government claims Starlink is not allowed to enter the market despite Musk's claims of compliance.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Elon Musk accused Ambani of seeking to protect his monopoly and urged him to allow Starlink to compete, saying satellite internet could improve access to education and markets.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The government claims Starlink is not allowed to enter India despite Musk's claims of compliance with all laws and requirements of the government.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Musk also mentioned that the government has spent five years complying with every single law and requirement of the government.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
